translations: ['you, a crushed child from Kwangtung?', 'a child whose ancestors hung over the gap in Sierras and pushed the dynamite into a scroll in rock?', 'I just want you to turn into a flour on the wall.', 'thy ancestors now turn in the graves.', 'too much pressure on me. You pressure me.', 'I am not a slave.', 'I ended up as a security guard.', 'I ended up with a shocking shock.', 'I send home a little less money.', "I don't have  ⁇ as eating.", 'I am  ⁇ asto evil.', "if I die, so I'm fucked.", 'my family will be fucked in my ass.', 'a pro- ⁇ ?', 'what do you mean? What do you mean?', ', however, none of the interested parties submitted an alternative to any alternative.', 'revision is based on the adjusted capacity data provided by the applicant and covering the entire Union industry.', 'revised data shall be accompanied by references to publicly available data concerning, in particular, unused capacity and capacity of manufacturers who stopped operation due to financial difficulties.', 'as explained above in Section 6 ‘Macroeconomic indicators’, revised data provide a much more precise set of capacity data available for the production of biodiesel during the period considered than the data originally provided and published in the provisional Regulation.', 'every error is erroneous.', "you know what it's like? Do you know what it's like?", 'for heavy sins, you have a lot for a lot.', 'in light sins, you can find little.', 'you understand? Do you understand?', 'the man killed a guy and I helped him.', 'I was happy.', '! forgive me for forgiveness.', 'you have to go to work, go to work!', 'Geum-jao, what do those eye shadows mean?', ', you know why those kids...', ': hey, hey, hey, hey!', "here's another! Here's another! Here's another!", 'Hello? Hello?', '[5] Communication from the Commission to the European Parliament, the Council, the European Economic and Social Committee and the Committee of the Regions: the Digital Agenda for Europe, COM(2010) 245 final, 28.8.2010.', 'in Europe The Erasmus Programme and Leonardo da Vinci European Commission Homepage News Transport and Travel Energy and Natural Resources of the EU in Cost of Economic, Finance and Tax Culture, Education and Youth Enterprise Regions and Local Development Justice and Civil Rights Science and Technology Foreign Policy EU Employment and Social Rights Agriculture, Fisheries and Food Environment, Consumer Protection and Health Studium and Training abroad?', "o, you don't want to see the cellar, shit.", 'the documentary evidence of you?', 'now, get out of nowhere.', 'the house is not for sale.', 'the way it was? So what was like?', 'was it... experience?', ', yeah. Yeah. Yeah, yeah.', 'it was certainly a experience of experience.', "what's this smell like? What's it like smelling?", ', yeah. Yeah. Yeah, yeah.', 'it is... secret Navay Flowers and...', ', hey, is everything okay? Is everything okay?', 'not. No.', ', not even in any way.', ', in fact, actually, is not at all.', ': Application of EU legislation Answer from the Council (3 November 2009)', 'it should have been only a test...', 'Samah stared at Xara with a vigorous request in his eyes.', 'it was all. It was all. It was all.', 'the difficult test of the difficult test.', 'it should teach you humility and patience.', 'it should mitigate your aggressiveness ..."', '," said Xar quietly, quietly.', '," Samah said slowly, bowing his head slowly.', 'the slabite you."', 'you were afraid of us."', 'we were afraid of you."', 'you hoped that we die..."', 'not."', 'Samah shook his head.', 'Labyrint became a challenge of this hope.', 'there is nothing larger or older than the universe.', 'I would like to talk about the following issues:', 'we in the universe ourselves? We are we alone in space?', 'pursuant to Articles 46 EC and 55 EC, Articles 43 EC and 49 EC do not preclude restrictions on justified grounds of public health.', 'I say what I heard.', 'they heard it even the other cops.', ": It means that I'm going to go to Kojar after me.", "the fuckin' shit.", 'it is for the sacrifice. This is for the sake of sacrifice.', "I don't know what to do with Freeb, but I'm helping you. And no one knows, except kisses.", 'they ease it on me?', 'every person has someone.', 'you want me to drive away from me?', "that you told me I'd leave, -they won't help me."]
